WEBVTT

00:00:58.422 --> 00:01:01.725
We also know that two sleep disorders,

00:01:01.749 --> 00:01:06.117
including insomnia and sleep apnea,
or heavy snoring,

00:01:06.141 --> 00:01:09.212
are associated with
a significantly higher risk

00:01:09.236 --> 00:01:12.186
of Alzheimer's disease in late life.

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:15.979
Those are, of course,
simply associational studies.

00:01:16.003 --> 00:01:17.781
They don't prove causality.

00:01:17.805 --> 00:01:19.209
But more recently,

00:01:19.233 --> 00:01:23.376
we actually have identified
that causal evidence.

00:01:23.755 --> 00:01:26.574
In fact, if you take a healthy human being

00:01:26.598 --> 00:01:29.555
and you deprive them
of sleep for just one night,

00:01:29.579 --> 00:01:33.285
and the next day,
we see an immediate increase